  "description_text": "Exceptional opportunity to own in the desirable Loyal Heights Ballard neighborhood. Offering 2,061 finished sq ft, 4 bedrooms, 3.25 baths, and modern NW Contemporary architecture, this residence pairs stylish design with effortless urban convenience. The exterior features dark composite paneling, neutral horizontal siding, paver paths, and a vibrant red entry door. Inside, enjoy a light-filled layout boasting high-efficiency ductless mini-split heating and cooling, engineered hardwood and ceramic tile flooring, and a dedicated dining room. The fully equipped kitchen comes complete with a refrigerator, range, dishwasher, disposal, and microwave, alongside an in-home washer and dryer. On the first floor, you'll find a bedroom and a den/office space ideal for remote work. Upstairs, discover two top-level bedrooms, including a primary suite. Additional features include a 1-car attached garage with a modern glass-paneled door, high-efficiency electric water heater, and low-maintenance grounds. All of this is located moments from Golden Gardens Beach, Shilshole Bay Marina, and the vibrant shops and dining of Ballard and Loyal Heights.",
