  "description_text": "Welcome to this brand-new, free standing, thoughtfully designed home in Sunset Hill. Step inside to a bright and inviting main floor, where abundant natural light fills the open living, dining, and kitchen spaces. The thoughtfully designed kitchen features a striking full-tile wall and warm wood paneling along the back of the island, with an open layout that connects effortlessly to the dining and living spaces, creating an inviting setting for everyday living and entertaining. The spacious living area flows seamlessly to a private patio, perfect for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing. Upstairs, find two additional bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a conveniently included washer and dryer. The primary suite impresses with vaulted ceilings, large windows, and a charming private balcony. A spa-like bathroom with an oversized shower and linen closet complete the retreat. Top it all off with a spacious rooftop deck, ideal for entertaining or enjoying the fresh Seattle air. Convenient off-street alley parking adds everyday ease. Enjoy easy access to the shops, restaurants, and everyday amenities along the Crown Hill corridor. Just minutes from Golden Gardens Park, Ballard's vibrant dining scene, and beautiful waterfront sunsets, this home offers the perfect blend of modern design and Northwest living.",
